[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238991\">7065C72</a></p><p>1. Extract the bulb holder.</p><p>2. Extract the bulb from the bulb holder. (Press fit).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019548.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Insert the bulb in the bulb\nholder.</p><p>Reinsert the bulb holder in the ashtray.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238991\">7065C72</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238991\">7065C72</a></p><p>1. Release and remove the bulb holder ring nut (1a) releasing the\nretainer (1b) from the housing (1c).</p><p>2. Extract the bulb holder and bulb (press fit).</p><p>3. Extract the bulb (press fit).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019549.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the bulb is not damaged.</p><p>Fit the bulb in position.</p><p>Fit the bulb holder in place.</p><p>Fit the bulb holder ring nut in place and\nattach the retainer.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238991\">7065C72</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p>"]]